{"id":200,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"富士未来学で理数的発見力と挑戦力を育てる","feature_description":"都立富士高校・附属中学校は、教養主義を基盤とした6年間の中高一貫教育を行い、挑戦力・理数的発見力・理数的解決力を育てます。課題研究「富士未来学」を中核に、SSH等の取組も通じて、科学技術と国際社会に貢献できる人材を目指します。英語教育推進校、スポーツ特別強化指定校、文化部推進校として多様な活動を支え、自主自律・文武両道の理念を掲げています。","clubs":[{"id":14670,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14671,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14672,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14673,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14674,"name":"薙刀部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14675,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14676,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14677,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14678,"name":"フラッグフットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14679,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14680,"name":"科学探究部天文班","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/fuji-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14681,"name":"科学探究部生物班","category":"文化部","source_url":